  "detail_text": "THIS IS NOT A REQUEST FOR QUOTE (RFQ). THE GOVERNMENT WILL NOT PAY FOR ANY COSTS ASSOCIATED WITH RESPONDING TO THIS PRESOLICITATION. The Government intends to issue a Firm-Fixed-Price (FFP) sole source solicitation/contract to Riegl USA (Cage Code 1RMP5). Riegl USA is the OEM and the only authorized service provider for the referenced scanner for the following requirement: 2 Year Maintenance for Riegl VZ-20001 3D TLS Qty: 1 ea. Type: Service Estimated Delivery Schedule: On or Before 20 May 2026 Anticipated Award: 03/20/2026 Firm-Fixed-Price (FFP) Contract",
